@startuml
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> QuietCapacity : Hub Opens Shift\n[currentActiveOrders < 50% max]

QuietCapacity --> NormalCapacity : startPreparation() / newOrder()\n[50% <= activeOrders < maxActiveOrders]
NormalCapacity --> QuietCapacity : markOrderReady() / orderDelivered()\n[activeOrders < 50% max]

NormalCapacity --> OverloadedBusyRule : newOrder()\n[currentActiveOrders == maxActiveOrders]
OverloadedBusyRule : entry / blockNewOrders()\ndo / offerQuietHubIncentive()

OverloadedBusyRule --> NormalCapacity : markOrderReady(orderId)\n[activeOrders drops below maxActiveOrders]

NormalCapacity --> [*] : Hub Closes Shift
QuietCapacity --> [*] : Hub Closes Shift
@enduml